    "Save keeps the original unchanged and saves a copy as %@. Don't Save discards these marks.":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Save keeps the original unchanged and saves a copy as %@. Don't Save discards these marks."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"存储会另存为 %@，原图不变。不存储则丢弃这些标记。"}}}},
