    "Mado can’t find “%@”. Choose its location, or choose another folder to continue.":{"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"It may have been deleted, put in the Trash, or be on a different disk. If it’s elsewhere, choose it at its new location to continue."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"它可能已被删除、放进了废纸篓，或不在原来的磁盘上。\n如果它在别处，在新位置重新选择它即可继续。"}}}},
