    "On macOS 15 and later, the system may ask again from time to time whether Mado can capture the screen. This is required by macOS; choose Allow to continue taking screenshots.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "On macOS 15 and later, the system may ask again from time to time whether Mado can capture the screen. This is required by macOS; choose Allow to continue taking screenshots."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "在 macOS 15 及以后，系统会不定期再次询问是否允许 Mado 截取屏幕。这是系统要求，选择允许即可继续截图。"}}}},
